I was traveling more and more and needed basically I'm very cheap or frugal however you want to put it.

24
00:02:05,840 --> 00:02:09,680
And I wanted not to pay for flights basically or get them as cheap as possible.

25
00:02:10,800 --> 00:02:19,200
And so I kind of got turned on to the whole world of credit card rewards, which is this whole kind of fascinating hobby and world in and of itself.

26
00:02:20,080 --> 00:02:30,320
But even just getting lightly into it, it's a really easy way to get flights basically for free or for just a few bucks in taxes, just with some credit card sign up bonuses and using the right credit cards.

27
00:02:30,560 --> 00:02:31,920
So that's kind of how it started.

28
00:02:32,080 --> 00:02:36,080
I wanted to better optimize when I was using my cards, kind of keep track of everything.

29
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:44,800
