Like, they don't understand what that is.

180
00:13:04,800 --> 00:13:05,840
They don't see value in that.

181
00:13:07,120 --> 00:13:12,640
Even when eventually the app came out, it was still really hard to get that next step and get those links in place.

182
00:13:13,440 --> 00:13:17,360
They just didn't want to take a chance on it, but I was just hoping that eventually I'd figure it out.

183
00:13:17,520 --> 00:13:19,200
So I just kind of kept building.

184
00:13:19,360 --> 00:13:20,240
I kept getting traction.

