00:13:41,920 --> 00:13:48,320
So this was like a goal you had written up on the wall or something like five thousand I can't touch Xcode until five thousand users.

192
00:13:48,400 --> 00:13:52,800
Was that five thousand cumulative users or like monthly active or Oh no, just five thousand total users.

